    "narrative": "As we look toward today's slate, **Mickey Moniak** (75.75) stands as our clear anchor, benefiting from a highly favorable matchup against Michael King. His score is bolstered significantly by a 14% park factor boost and a strong platoon advantage, making him our primary source of upside. **Isaac Paredes** (69.54) also projects as an elite play in the #3 hole against Seth Lugo; his score is pushed well into \"Strong\" territory thanks to a 14% SP Skill adjustment and the high-leverage opportunity provided by the 3-spot in the order. **Vinnie Pasquantino** (58.64) remains a solid, if marginal, start as he continues to be a steady presence, though he lacks the high-end ceiling of our primary outfield options today.\n\nWe are navigating a few \"Lineup Pending\" designations for **Moises Ballesteros** and **Trevor Story**, which injects a level of volatility into our projections. **Moises Ballesteros** (54.94) carries a positive wind adjustment that keeps him in the starting mix, while **Brice Turang** (54.17) is an automatic start despite a tough matchup against Dotel; his elite sprint speed and top-of-the-order positioning remain essential to our pursuit of SB category dominance. **Trevor Story** (48.15) holds the lowest score among our starters, and with the optimizer keeping a close eye on his recent performance, he is the most likely candidate to be swapped should the official lineup report show him sliding further down the order. \n\nOur bench management remains strictly dictated by availability, with **Corbin Carroll**, **Josh Naylor**, and **James Wood** all sidelined by team off-days. **Tyler Soderstrom** remains a non-factor due to his ongoing IL status. Looking forward, our depth chart including **Jose Caballero**, **Austin Riley**, **Giancarlo Stanton**, **Seiya Suzuki**, **Gabriel Moreno**, **Max Muncy**, **Dalton Rushing**, **Cole Young**, **Griffin Conine**, **Edwin Arroyo**, and **Travis Bazzana** is ready to rotate in as scheduling allows. For today, we are effectively playing the cards we are dealt, prioritizing the platoon advantages of **Mickey Moniak** and **Isaac Paredes** to insulate our Roto standing.",
